DESCRIPTION:Theatre\nhttps://ma.to/event/in-the-mood-for-love-20-nov-2026\
 n\nWong Kar-wai’s 2000 film In the Mood for Love screens at New People 
 Cinema in San Francisco’s Japantown. Set in early-’60s Hong Kong\, it
  stars Maggie Cheung and Tony Leung as neighbors brought together by the 
 suspicion that their spouses are having an affair. Tickets are available 
 via The Roxie Theater.
